SUMMARY:The Cure Halloween Party
LOCATION:Bowery Palace\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:DJ Chase '77 kicks things off at 7 with a Cure music video DJ s
 
et. Then She's In Parties (Weird Magazines/Imperial Motors) takes the stage
 
 as BAUHAUS\, followed by The Bitter And The Sweet (Some of Mine) performin
 
g SIOUXSIE & THE BANSHEES. While the final act sets up\, visit hairstylist 
 
Antonio V's chair to complete your goth look with a complimentary updo Then
 
 Depresión Tropical summons the spirit of Robert Smith et al.\, performing
 
 your favorite songs by THE CURE. Following the performances\, Chase '77 sp
 
ins The Cure as well as other new wave\, post-punk and dark wave\, conjurin
 
g a gothic DANCE PARTY that will go 'til close LIMITED NUMBER OF $10 EARLY 
 
BIRD TIX AVAILABLE Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-cure
 
-halloween-party-bowery-palace-tickets/14324204
