na Vista Social Club is truly a show for everyone. The songs enrich the sto
 
ry\, infusing it with an authentic Havana heartbeat. You won't lose the plo
 
t if you don't understand the lyrics - what matters most is how the music m
 
akes you feel. (4) This production uses theatrical haze and smoke. (5) Tick
 
