SUMMARY:Sydnee Washington: My Black Barbie Story
LOCATION:The Bell House\, Carroll Gardens-Cobble Hill-Gowanus-Red Hook
DESCRIPTION:Sydnee Washington has lived many lives. Lowkey high key\, night
 
s so embarrassing only Black Barbie can reenact in a stop motion live show.
 
 Follow Sydnee's life story from childhood\, to making questionable decisio
 
ns as a bottle girl in the iconic nightclubs of 2010s NYC--& how she eventu
 
ally made her way out through sobriety &\, funnily enough\, stand-up comedy
 
. Join her in an unhinged night of judgment\, laughs & maybe even a bit of 
 
inspiration. W/ Liza Treyger & Devon Walker. *Lineup subject to change. Doo
 
r Time: 6:30pm (front bar opens: 5:30pm). Show Time: 7:30pm. 21 & over w/ v
 
alid\, government-issued photo ID. General Admission standing & seating. Se
 
ating 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for best selection
 
. No outside food/drink. If you have an accessibility request\, please emai
 
l thebellhouse@livenation.com prior. $.25 per each ticket sold for a majori
 
ty of events @ The Bell House benefits Comedy Gives Back. IG: @comedygivesb
 
ack. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/sydnee-washington-my-blac
 
k-barbie-story-brooklyn-new-york-10-23-2026/event/300065273C85AE0A
